# Online (Render): kuwan ku geli Render → Environment. Local tijaabo: koobiyee → .env

# AI-ga: gemini (BILAASH — key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
#        groq   (BILAASH — key: https://console.groq.com/keys)
#        openrouter | openai | claude
